        {
          "text": "Sefatia Matani mvi pi, Gedalia Pasuri mvi pie, Yukali Selemia mvi pie, Pasuri Malakiya mvi pie, yi eri e’yo Yeremiani ’yole ’ba dria ma tiari kini, ",
